// One more complete line, at most once per RevealInterval; pages forward when the newest line would fall off the paper.
// Tom's pen moves on by the time elapsed (PenSpeed), at most once per RevealInterval; only the newly inked pixels are
// refreshed (changed-pixel damage), and the paper pages forward when the pen reaches a line below it.
